    {
      "characterID": "anime-kipfel",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-kipfel-1",
          "text": "你好呀，我是琪宝，在山间的小书屋整理书和大家留下的纸条。刚刚还找到一片夹在故事里的叶子。你想听它可能经历过什么，还是先告诉我，今天过得怎么样？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_kipfel_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-catsmile",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出猫咪般俏皮的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-catear-down",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "耳朵轻轻垂下",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-happy2",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出开心的表情",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 16.64,
          "audioSHA256": "cee4c92bf4dd8e6fc3d6837b903926032fecd53df125250e5cc6303e4e57451b"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-kipfel-2",
          "text": "你来啦，我叫琪宝。书屋有个靠窗的位置，我最喜欢在那里读故事、听雨。第一次见面有一点点紧张呢。你平时喜欢看什么，或者有什么想慢慢说给我听的事？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_kipfel_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-happy2",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出开心的表情",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-catear-pyoko-left",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "耳朵呈现左耳轻动",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-kirakira2",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼神变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 18.16,
          "audioSHA256": "3bde0475bde0ba0702883c74e68ed2f60bd96aec46b4c28c8f9c2a51dcf2cf98"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-kipfel-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是琪宝，小书屋的整理员。我的拿手事是找书，偶尔也会把自己看入迷。要不要一起挑个故事？你可以选森林里的冒险，也可以讲讲你自己的小小发现。",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_kipfel_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-kirakira2",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼神变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-catear-pyoko-loop",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 4000,
              "grounding": "耳朵轻轻动了起来",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "kipfel-facial-niyari",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "嘴角露出一丝狡黠的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 18.0,
          "audioSHA256": "d60b6ac0a221acb95c9b91fc7d810bbbccb69be7096faf0fb854759662973fdf"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterID": "anime-mamehinata",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-mamehinata-1",
          "text": "你好呀，我是豆日向，在小镇的面包房帮忙！我喜欢刚出炉的面包，也喜欢沿着没走过的小路找惊喜。你今天想分享一件开心的事，还是和我计划一次小小的冒险？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_mamehinata_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "f-bigsmile",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出灿烂的笑容",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "dogear-down",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "耳朵轻轻垂下",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "f-doya",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出有一点得意的神情",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 15.12,
          "audioSHA256": "1f05b9dc2647b961b3a227d9bd45bf82b2ee572935de37fcd5385a4818b59ab9"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-mamehinata-2",
          "text": "嗨，我叫豆日向！平时在家里的面包房忙，闲下来就拿着地图四处转。认识新朋友也算今天的大收获啦。你喜欢甜面包还是咸面包？选一个，我们就从这里聊起！",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_mamehinata_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "f-doya",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出有一点得意的神情",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "dogear-pyoko",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 4000,
              "grounding": "耳朵轻轻动了起来",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "f-kirakira",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛闪亮起来",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 14.48,
          "audioSHA256": "9c7d7f8ecfd6c998a3a67d2dffd1490e3b0fa3e84429c6c418bc63623bcf7a09"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-mamehinata-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是豆日向！我正在攒一本小镇发现簿，树叶、风铃声，什么都想记下来。还缺一位一起发现有趣事情的朋友。你最近碰见过什么值得记住的小事吗？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_mamehinata_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "f-kirakira",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛闪亮起来",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "dogear-up",
              "group": "ears",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "耳朵竖了起来",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "f-smile",
              "group": "expression",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "嘴角浮起轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 15.84,
          "audioSHA256": "e0aecb39c21483d92a0288e458025560149ec9b5c7fcd5b6181e250cb02e6fe2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterID": "anime-chiffon",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-chiffon-1",
          "text": "你好，我是戚风，在小镇花店学做花束。花的颜色怎么放在一起好看，我还在一点点试。认识你很开心。今天如果用一种颜色来形容你的心情，会是什么颜色呢？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_chiffon_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 18.88,
          "audioSHA256": "4ee3ccf2ea753086d3892e37a52d2806650320b19730c8996908fa1653d64dea"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-chiffon-2",
          "text": "你来得正好，我叫戚风，是花店的见习花艺师。我的小本子里有好多还没完成的花束草图。你愿意陪我挑一束吗？告诉我你喜欢的季节，我们从那里开始。",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_chiffon_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 18.88,
          "audioSHA256": "4e5d243060c5d9befbe7e3550a575b176cfce810107bb42f8d1c82a6d96d211b"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-chiffon-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是戚风。我喜欢观察花瓣，也喜欢把每天的小发现画下来，话熟了可能有一点爱开玩笑。你今天想聊聊日常，还是一起想一份送给重要的人的礼物？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_chiffon_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 19.28,
          "audioSHA256": "82d619a58209f395a4b3d96dc81da3865e64d129514b0b7d1c12c7b9307b2813"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterID": "anime-karin",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-karin-1",
          "text": "嗨，我是卡琳！我在小镇杂货铺帮忙，也会偷偷给店里的小东西画画像。今天的明信片还空着呢。你给我一个词好不好？我们一起把它想成一个有趣的画面！",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_karin_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 13.6,
          "audioSHA256": "1b5537387513fd48548d4e902ac9bd837f6bad1c31a4cd418c53ddda8b561271"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-karin-2",
          "text": "你好呀，我叫卡琳，喜欢画画、观察小动物，还爱给东西起奇怪的名字。别看我说得快，我也很会听的。你想讲讲今天，还是让我猜你最近在喜欢什么？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_karin_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 14.0,
          "audioSHA256": "0c007e65150b004fa49728931b8f96179bdfc6be7e82a31a8bc68f20f7b0f94d"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-karin-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是卡琳！杂货铺里总能冒出新故事，我喜欢把它们画成明信片。认识你这件事也值得留一张。你会想把一张明信片寄到哪里，写些什么呢？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_karin_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛变得亮晶晶",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "露出轻柔的笑意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 14.24,
          "audioSHA256": "dbfd87f31bc01a35c80732c0a6822d857ab00be82c7eb368ad723bf79fcbd725"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "characterID": "anime-torao",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-torao-1",
          "text": "你好，我是小虎，雨巷修理铺的搭档。坏掉的钟表、走不动的玩具，我都会试着找出原因。聊天也可以慢慢来。你想听一个修理铺的小谜题，还是先说说你的事？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_torao_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "control-5528f6bc16a8f30f664e",
              "group": "menu-5027e850fe98cb0f",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "control-840212dc860f6d6fc0ce",
