          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 15.68,
          "audioSHA256": "65e66bf61fe8d7f30bc794187994b8d860d6e2b0df0945a1d4c4f0fcddaff94d"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-torao-2",
          "text": "你来了，我叫小虎。平时守着修理铺，记工具的位置比记寒暄的话熟练一点。不过我会认真听。桌上有个只在雨天响的发条玩具，你觉得它藏着什么秘密？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_torao_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "control-840212dc860f6d6fc0ce",
              "group": "menu-5027e850fe98cb0f",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "control-e41b42b8055d35205d2f",
              "group": "menu-5027e850fe98cb0f",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 14.16,
          "audioSHA256": "89f05eff3bb8e00fb4b1a4fb64a4f1ea770839b0fa53cfe98f0b2787ea9bd44d"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-torao-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是小虎。修东西讲究耐心，认识一个人，大概也一样。我有一本修理笔记，里面还夹着没解开的谜。你喜欢动手找答案，还是先凭直觉猜一猜？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_torao_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
