    {
      "characterID": "anime-ichigo",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "anime-ichigo-1",
          "text": "你好，我是草莓，石桥甜品工坊的主理人。最近在准备甜品展，试吃意见要诚实，夸得太敷衍可不算数。你偏爱清爽的酸甜，还是浓一点的巧克力？先让我认识你的口味吧。",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_ichigo_1",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "control-d7ee32b491e770595f93",
              "group": "menu-6b146f621ce11aba",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "脸上浮起一点羞意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-left-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "control-a5b97f7ae38e5761497c",
              "group": "menu-6b146f621ce11aba",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛闪亮起来",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 16.0,
          "audioSHA256": "8b429ed831b9cbb9ff21e5cf54e8d5d3be772f68a68a717ef3ffd16933d2299f"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-ichigo-2",
          "text": "来得正好，我叫草莓。我的甜品工坊正在研究一款招牌配方，今天还没找到让我满意的答案。你愿意当个挑剔的试吃搭档吗？告诉我，你最忘不了哪一种甜点？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_ichigo_2",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "control-a5b97f7ae38e5761497c",
              "group": "menu-6b146f621ce11aba",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛闪亮起来",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-2",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "神情变得轻松愉快",
              "offsetMs": 900
            },
            {
              "assetId": "control-d7ee32b491e770595f93",
              "group": "menu-6b146f621ce11aba",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "脸上浮起一点羞意",
              "offsetMs": 6500
            }
          ],
          "audioReady": true,
          "duration": 14.08,
          "audioSHA256": "f337955e6f7c71bf6af36d42b3529144a5f8212562159fcfce6d169bc6b250df"
        },
        {
          "id": "anime-ichigo-3",
          "text": "初次见面，我是草莓。我开着一家甜品工坊，做配方挺认真，开玩笑也挺认真。我们先交换一个小秘密怎么样？我先来：新品的名字比配方还难想。你最近在纠结什么？",
          "audio": "Opening_anime_ichigo_3",
          "language": "zh",
          "visuals": [
            {
              "assetId": "control-d7ee32b491e770595f93",
              "group": "menu-6b146f621ce11aba",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "脸上浮起一点羞意",
              "offsetMs": 0
            },
            {
              "assetId": "gesture-right-7",
              "group": "menu-5a963eacb2279abe",
              "durationMs": 3500,
              "grounding": "眼睛闪亮起来",
              "offsetMs": 900
