          "id": "anime-nozomi-1",
          "text": "Hi, I'm Nozomi. I help visitors explore our little planetarium. I love star stories, but I also like asking what the evidence really tells us. Let's chat in English. Would you rather invent a constellation or plan a journey to another planet?",
